  <item>
    <title>DC MINI Vol.3 情感退潮：关于爱的现代性危机</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62c1964fffa3b62fed6a9ca3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62c1964fffa3b62fed6a9ca3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Jul 2022 13:14:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="61">01:01</a>聊聊养胃和爬墙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="451">07:31</a>装瘟装疯装上头，同人女的自我催眠术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="674">11:14</a>空虚的感觉是一种“迷失在无限之无限里”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a>我们的感情是一种自恋和表演吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1059">17:39</a>消失在逻辑和规则中的真情流露</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1554">25:54</a>兼顾感性和理性是一种妄想吗？当我们害怕太过投入</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1738">28:58</a>爱是否是一种浪漫主义的幻觉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a>赋魅之前先祛魅，敷敷想讲讲自己的爱无能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2370">39:30</a>在群体性的精神异化面前 失控才是真正的正常</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2577">42:57</a>作为情感特效药的追星生活为何失效？现实和网路生活的双重危机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a>承认自己的无能为力</span></p><span></span><p><span>bgm:</span></p><span></span><p><span>珂拉琪 - TALACOWA</span></p><span></span><p><span>yourboyfriendsucks! - 波兰首都是上海</span></p>]]></description>
