    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>DC MINI Vol.1 以我观偶像 偶像皆着我之色彩（吗）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/621a1bb56572fee26fe83624</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">621a1bb56572fee26fe83624</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 26 Feb 2022 12:23:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 一个简短的介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="116">01:56</a>同人创作的投影仪理论</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">01:57</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="268">04:28</a> 同人创作的本体是TA本人还是作者？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="269">04:29</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="388">06:28</a>近乡情怯！爱谁最多就书写谁最多的逻辑成立吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="389">06:29</a>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="568">09:28</a>瞄准偶像的方式：故事比形容词更准确</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="568">09:28</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="842">14:02</a> 同人创作的禁区和阻力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="842">14:02</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1002">16:42</a> 真正让人恐惧的OOC是合理的OOC</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1002">16:42</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1135">18:55</a>以我观偶像,偶像皆着我之色彩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1135">18:55</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1473">24:33</a> 当“通透”成为所有偶像的代名词,它还存在价值吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1474">24:34</a> -<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a>你最爱的那点往往伤你最深，过了分的优点还算优点吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">25:30</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1804">30:04</a>同人女适合追线下吗？关于想象的破灭和平面的三维化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1803">30:03</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2174">36:14</a>当TA溢出词语的集合之外 Miss春和浮浮的破大防瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2175">36:15</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2302">38:22</a>拉郎的意义是什么？同人女的化学实验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2303">38:23</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2444">40:44</a>同人作者到底在不在意反馈？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2444">40:44</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2576">42:56</a>代餐成立的必要条件是又饿又馋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2577">42:57</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2793">46:33</a> 同人女需要分析和自我分析吗？在沉浸式的快乐中情感和分析哪个更重要？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2794">46:34</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2867">47:47</a>恭喜你！没有得到任何的收获</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/llgCsIgNoMjByf_90OwT0EAS5xX_.m4a" length="46730719" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:58</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZuOVFiUTNKSWFiVmIyTEhVZlBpNHR5VzFXVFQucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>DC MINI Vol.0 |  我们从哪里来 经历什么 我们到哪里去</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/620655412cb5c6cf1b2a0018</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">620655412cb5c6cf1b2a0018</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 11 Feb 2022 12:23:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>DCmini的名字从何处来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="152">02:32</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="299">04:59</a>沐浴球的小卖部同人初体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="299">04:59</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a>浮浮从二次元开始的贴吧同人之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a>如何用老人机搞同人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="720">12:00</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">17:38</a>从足球球星嗑到后偶像练习生时代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1058">17:38</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1216">20:16</a>元祖同人女的知识分子性与简中泥塑发展史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1216">20:16</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1584">26:24</a>耽美需要有社会意义吗？追忆那些风云太太的往事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1584">26:24</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2209">36:49</a>同人女一代不如一代了？关于同人文成为样板戏这件事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2209">36:49</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2375">39:35</a>沐浴球想看同人女青春疼痛电影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2375">39:35</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2688">44:48</a>同人环境巨变谁之过？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2688">44:48</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2925">48:45</a>该对文学有道德要求吗？今天我们怎样做读者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2925">48:45</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3060">51:00</a>同人女该往何处去：浮浮与沐浴球的展望</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvAxgaALkAWKTyfQfr_dq-6b20yv.m4a" length="49894547" type="audio/mp4"/>
